            "title": "Question: del",
            "id": 96242,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kod ne yazdıracak?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"side = \" /><text value=\"&quot;salad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"meal = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Steak&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", side]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" meal[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(side)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"salad\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>salad</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey, bir hata gösterilir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>chips</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>salad</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del meal[-1]</code> çalıştıktan sonra <code>meal</code> ve <code>side</code> değişkenlerini hangi ifade açıklar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"side = \" /><text value=\"&quot;salad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"meal = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Steak&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", side]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" meal[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(side)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"salad\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">meal artık salad içermez ancak side hâlâ salad depolar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hem meal hem side salad değerini kaybeder</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">side aynı değeri depoladığı için meal hâlâ salad içerir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">meal artık salad içermez ancak side hâlâ salad depolar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
