          {
            "title": "Example: del list item",
            "id": 96244,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>shopping</code> listesi 3 öğeden uzunsa son öğeyi silmek için <code>del</code> kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;bananas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;oranges&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemons&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;carrots&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;beans&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" len(shopping) &gt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shopping[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"104\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['bananas', 'oranges', 'lemons', 'carrots']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>del shopping[-1]</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: del uses",
            "id": 96247,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code> aşağıdakilerden hangisini silmek için kullanılabilir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Veri yapıları içindeki öğeler de dahil olmak üzere herhangi bir nesne referansı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir listenin yalnızca bazı kısımları</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bir sözlükte yalnızca anahtar:değer çiftleri</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Veri yapıları içindeki öğeler de dahil olmak üzere herhangi bir nesne referansı.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code>, veri yapısındaki bir öğe de dahil olmak üzere bir nesne referansını silebilir.</p><p><code>scores</code> bir liste depoluyorsa hangi çiftteki ikisi de <code>del</code> için geçerli hedefler olabilir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">scores ve scores[0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca scores[0], çünkü değişkenler silinemez</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca scores, çünkü liste öğeleri silinemez</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">scores ve scores[0] öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: del object",
            "id": 96245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodu, <code>permissions</code> demetindeki son öğe <code>False</code> ise <code>cookies</code> silinecek şekilde tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;site_access&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;adverts&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"permissions = (\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" permissions[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] == \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cookies deleted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Cookies deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>-</code>, ardından <code>1</code> ve sonra <code>del</code>, <code>cookies</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>permissions</code> demetindeki <strong>son</strong> öğe <code>False</code> olduğunda <code>cookies</code> değişkenini sil.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;site_access&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;adverts&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"permissions = (\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" permissions[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] == \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cookies deleted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Cookies deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>-</code>, ardından <code>1</code>, <code>==</code>, <code>del</code> ve son olarak <code>cookies</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: clean dict",
            "id": 96246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>users</code> sözlüğünden <code>Jason</code>'ı kaldırmak için kodu tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dave&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Manager&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;CEO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Apprentice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users[\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"keys\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'Dave': (27, 'Manager'), 'Alexis': (33, 'CEO')}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>del</code>, ardından <code>users</code> ve son olarak <code>\"Jason\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rolü <code>Apprentice</code> olan kullanıcıyı sözlükten kaldır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dave&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Manager&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;CEO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Apprentice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users[\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"keys\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'Dave': (27, 'Manager'), 'Alexis': (33, 'CEO')}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>del</code>, ardından <code>users</code> ve son olarak <code>\"Jason\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: negative stepping",
            "id": 96337,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>[\"H\", \"e\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\"]</code> yazdırılacak şekilde kodu tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scrambled = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;y&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;o&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;a&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;f&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;H&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;z&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hello = scrambled[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(hello)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['H', 'e', 'l', 'l', 'o']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>2</code>, ardından <code>-</code> ve son olarak <code>2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Negatif indeks kullanarak <code>H</code> öğesinden başla, <code>2</code> indeksinden önce dur ve <code>[\"H\", \"e\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\"]</code> yazdırmak için ikişer adım geri git.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scrambled = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;y&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;o&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;a&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;f&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;H&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;z&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hello = scrambled[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(hello)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['H', 'e', 'l', 'l', 'o']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>-2</code>, ardından <code>2</code>, <code>-</code> ve son olarak <code>2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: start values",
            "id": 96330,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hangi sıcaklıklar yazdırılacak?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[14, 16, 17, 12, 11]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hepsi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbiri - bir hata fırlatılır</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">İlki dışındakilerin tümü</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hepsi öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hangi ifade yalnızca son iki sıcaklığı, <code>[12, 11]</code>'i verir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[14, 16, 17, 12, 11]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>temperatures[-2:]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>temperatures[2:]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>temperatures[-2]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>temperatures[-2:]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
